{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39901","headline":"牡丹花二首 一 · 徐夤","name":"牡丹花二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"看徧花无胜此花，翦云披雪蘸丹砂。\n开当青律二三月，破却长安千万家。\n天纵穠华刳鄙吝，春教妖艳毒豪奢。\n不随寒令同时放，倍种双松与辟邪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}